  "verificationScope": "# Canonical global-to-internal SHEAF Ext comparison on ACTUAL Artinian closed support\n\nLET i:D->X be an ACTUAL closed immersion of schemes with IsArtinianScheme D. LET L be ANY original O_D-module sheaf,N ANY original O_X-module sheaf,n any natural number. THEN the SAME previously constructed resolution-independent canonical map lambda:Ext^(n+1)_O_X(i_*L,N)->Gamma(X,derived SHEAF Ext^(n+1)_O_X(i_*L,N)) is bijective. Its unit-morphism version and version computed by ANY actual coefficient injective resolution are also proved. A more general theorem assumes an actual closed map from a discrete source. This result is for positive degrees;no new degree-zero theorem is claimed.\n\nPROOF:actual direct-image sections vanish on opens disjoint the ACTUAL image;the already proved actual open Hom restriction iso transfers this to EVERY actual subobject of Hom(i_*L,N). Every open slice of the image is closed. Glue original sections with zero to prove actual flasqueness. The native mathlib flasque-kernel short-exact theorem and the pre-existing exact additive-sheaf forgetful functor give genuine section and structure-unit morphism lifting. For the SAME actual internal-Hom complex of the SAME coefficient injective resolution,prove every global homology class has an original cocycle and has zero class iff it has an original global primitive. The native Ext cocycle boundary criterion yields injectivity and surjectivity of the SAME canonical lambda. No lambda/inverse/acyclicity certificate is a final hypothesis. N may be non-quasicoherent and injective terms need not be quasicoherent. No global projectivity of O_X is assumed.\n\n25 independently audited ordinary theorem declarations;0 object/statement definitions;11 individually compiled roots. Complete exact types,standard axioms and proof roles read alongside actual LF proof sources,with per-declaration mathematical review and source/log hashes saved. Only propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound. All41 nonroot sources byte-match earlier verified PUBLIC archives. Fresh compiler source ranges and constant edges for ALL52 closed project modules;no partial parent metadata silently counted.\n\nOPEN:derive the actual original geometric cut/chain/chart specialization and SAME original functional restriction/support formula,then combine it with this proved finite-support lambda theorem and the original whole-top-cokernel class family. The native original chart data constructor remains UNVERIFIED after kernel ring-structure conversion timeouts and is EXCLUDED. Original4.1/4.2 and main theorem remain open. Preserve1<=r<n,d>=2,ONE NONEMPTY parameter open BEFORE ALL integer k,and parameteru/c distinct from finalQ. Proper duality/canonicaltheta4.1 and uniformm remain open;the admitted-as-unverified4.1interface is NOTan axiom. Distinguish global Ext,derived SHEAF Ext and affine MODULE Ext. Local freeness does not imply global projectivity;Hom full faithfulness does not imply Ext comparison. Whole local checkpoint180;181interrupted/notaccepted;no new whole-project LeanCI.\n\nOne compiler8GiB WindowsJob,2threads,CPU<=25%,BelowNormal,20minutes. All92 existing resource holds retained with unchanged records;no unchanged held retries or raised limits. All taskfiles D. Automation03:30-10:00Asia/Shanghai;no20minute compile starts after09:40. Lean4.35.0-rc3,pinnedmathlib2a885768dae569d938bb9ff3474da6a8753bb90a.\n",
